281	## Grounding with Google Search
282	
283	You can enable Grounding with Google Search as part of the session
284	configuration. This increases the Live API's accuracy and prevents
285	hallucinations. See the [Grounding tutorial](https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/grounding) to
286	learn more.
287	
288	### Python
289	
290	    import asyncio
291	    import wave
292	    from google import genai
293	    from google.genai import types
294	
295	    client = genai.Client()
296	
297	    model = "gemini-3.1-flash-live-preview"
298	
299	    tools = [{'google_search': {}}]
300	    config = {"response_modalities": ["AUDIO"], "tools": tools}
